<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria Expressbank has 1.4 bln lev 96 net profit.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria Expressbank has 1.4 bln lev 96 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's state-owned Expressbank posted 1.377 billion lev net profit for 1996 after a zero net profit the year before, the bank's balance sheet published in the State Gazette showed.</p>
<p>Figures from Varna-based bank's balance sheet and profit and loss account follow, in million levs unless stated otherwise:</p>
<p>						  1996		1995</p>
<p> Total revenue			   124,771.029     10,988.914</p>
<p> Total financial revenue	     120,978.762     10,963.543</p>
<p>Net interest income</p>
<p> on operations in levs		     518.758	 -278.128</p>
<p>Net interest income on</p>
<p> operations in foreign currency	1,536.267	  436.865</p>
<p> Gains on treasury paper		 4,895.654	  466.910</p>
<p>Foreign currency</p>
<p> translation gains			17,947.960	  198.950</p>
<p>Net income on commissions</p>
<p> and fees					466.406	  151.786</p>
<p> Business and administration costs   1,716.671	  687.056</p>
<p> Provisions				 25,148.244	  289.144</p>
<p> Taxes					   878.672	   15.919</p>
<p> Profit					1,377.484	     0.0</p>
<p> Total assets			     97,110.868	30,589.058</p>
<p> Cash					 28,910.044	 5,908.544</p>
<p> Treasury securities portfolio	14,602.558	 3,500.171</p>
<p> Extended interbank deposits	  10,236.808	 3,207.359</p>
<p> Attracted interbank deposits	  3,859.106	 1,694.210</p>
<p>Lending to non-financial</p>
<p> clients				    38,234.052	 16,431.486</p>
<p>Attracted deposits from</p>
<p> non-financial clients		  57,837.782	 21,183.173</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity		    4,109.521	  1,257.087</p>
<p> Reserves including provisions	26,504.932	  1,427.979</p>
<p>* Items not included</p>
<p> in the balance			  106,197.379	 33,079.539</p>
<p>* Items not included in the balance comprise guarantees and other commitments issued by the bank. -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
</text>
